menu "SPECTER-X lab configuration"

    choice SPECTER_WIFI_ROLE
        prompt "Wi-Fi role"
        default SPECTER_ROLE_STATION
        help
            STATION: the board joins a LOCAL access point (the Mac, or a
            second board) and measures the downlink CSI of the frames that
            point sends. This is the role the original image used and its
            behaviour is known.

            SOFTAP: the board IS the access point and the Mac is the
            station, so the board would measure the UPLINK CSI. Espressif
            ships no example of this and the ESP32-S3's Wi-Fi is a
            precompiled library, so whether the CSI callback fires in this
            mode is UNKNOWN. The firmware probes it at runtime: the
            SPECTER_STAT line carries csi_cb, and if it stays at zero while
            a station is connected and sending, the answer is no.
        config SPECTER_ROLE_STATION
            bool "Station - a local access point is the transmitter"
        config SPECTER_ROLE_SOFTAP
            bool "SoftAP - the Mac is the station"
    endchoice

    config SPECTER_LAB_SSID
        string "Lab network name"
        default "SPECTER-LAB"
        help
            The station role joins this SSID. The SoftAP role publishes it.
            It MUST be a local network - never a campus network.

    config SPECTER_LAB_PASSWORD
        string "Lab network password (empty for an open network)"
        default ""

    config SPECTER_LAB_CHANNEL
        int "Channel for the SoftAP role"
        depends on SPECTER_ROLE_SOFTAP
        default 6
        range 1 13

    config SPECTER_CSI_QUEUE_DEPTH
        int "CSI record queue depth"
        default 32
        range 8 256
        help
            How many CSI records may be waiting for the writer. At 178
            packets/s, 32 records is about 180 ms of buffer. When the queue
            is full the OLDEST record is dropped and the loss is counted
            and reported, so a slow host costs counted loss rather than a
            corrupted stream.

endmenu
